{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Cancerless 是一款以教育為本的癌症預防應用程式，適合希望瞭解自身風險、逐步建立健康習慣的讀者使用。程式提供乳房、前列腺、肺、大腸及一般生活因素的風險教育評估，並整理來自 American Cancer Society、U.S. Preventive Services Task Force 與 National Cancer Institute 等權威機構的淺白資訊，另設來源參考欄目供查閱。現時由原價 US $0.99 改為<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-91.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>癌症風險評估與習慣追蹤</h2>\n<p>使用者可完成乳房、前列腺、肺、大腸及一般生活因素的風險教育評估，瞭解煙草、酒精、體重、活動量、飲食與防曬如何影響長期風險。程式另支援每日習慣記錄與進度檢視，並可與教育用 AI 助理 Eddie 對話，加深對預防與篩查的認識。內容以淺白語言呈現並附資料來源。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-48.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-49.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-50.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-51.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-52.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-53.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Cancerless</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cancerless/id6783916380?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:13.200739+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:38.587930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:38.587930+00:00","content_hash":"57740d036b652eac1aad46bba4051709a0bb83f62280d64ee4551539124876bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}